WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.745 --> 00:00:16.545
opened his eyes.

2
00:00:18.527 --> 00:00:19.988
Mist rolled around him.

3
00:00:20.869 --> 00:00:23.632
He was in a beautiful valley with high mountains.

4
00:00:26.334 --> 00:00:27.976
He sat up, amazed.

5
00:00:30.644 --> 00:00:32.305
"I'm on the back of a big turtle!"

6
00:00:33.446 --> 00:00:36.369
The turtle was swimming in a wide, shining river.

7
00:00:41.753 --> 00:00:44.575
Suddenly the turtle dove deep into the water.

8
00:00:45.976 --> 00:00:49.479
Gildong grabbed the turtle's shell and held on tightly.

9
00:00:52.301 --> 00:00:55.384
Soon the turtle reached a cave and entered it.

10
00:01:00.012 --> 00:01:01.233
"What is this place?"

11
00:01:01.693 --> 00:01:03.595
Gildong thought, looking around.

12
00:01:05.296 --> 00:01:08.378
He saw a red orb sticking out of the wall.

13
00:01:10.679 --> 00:01:13.041
Gildong felt pulled toward the orb.

14
00:01:14.642 --> 00:01:16.623
He grabbed the orb and held it.

15
00:01:16.643 --> 00:01:21.947
"I've never seen this object before, but it feels familiar," he thought.

16
00:01:28.224 --> 00:01:31.005
The turtle carried Gildong back to the surface.

17
00:01:38.468 --> 00:01:41.229
A familiar laugh rumbled through the valley.

18
00:01:42.230 --> 00:01:43.870
Gildong knew that laugh.

19
00:01:44.691 --> 00:01:46.952
He looked around and saw Mongdol.

20
00:01:49.533 --> 00:01:52.534
He was huge and towered above the cliffs.

21
00:01:52.554 --> 00:01:56.135
"I told you we'd meet again soon!"

22
00:01:56.556 --> 00:01:57.376
Mongdol said.

23
00:01:58.240 --> 00:01:59.961
"Welcome back, Gildong."

24
00:02:01.221 --> 00:02:03.321
Gildong was happy to see his friend.

25
00:02:04.542 --> 00:02:06.342
But he was also confused.

26
00:02:06.362 --> 00:02:08.423
"I've been here before?"

27
00:02:08.443 --> 00:02:11.624
"Yes!" Mongdol said.

28
00:02:11.644 --> 00:02:14.785
"The thread of fate brought you home.

29
00:02:15.645 --> 00:02:16.725
You used to live here."

30
00:02:16.745 --> 00:02:20.566
"That doesn't make any sense," Gildong said.

31
00:02:20.586 --> 00:02:25.428
"This is the land of the gods," Mongdol said.

32
00:02:28.044 --> 00:02:29.325
"Tee-hee-hee." Gildong frowned.

33
00:02:29.345 --> 00:02:31.707
"Mongdol, this isn't funny.

34
00:02:32.368 --> 00:02:33.328
I don't understand."

35
00:02:35.130 --> 00:02:40.254
Slowly Mongdol turned into an old man wearing a dazzling white robe.

36
00:02:44.297 --> 00:02:46.920
lived here before as a blue dragon."

37
00:02:48.361 --> 00:02:50.082
His voice sounded different too.

38
00:02:51.684 --> 00:02:56.728
Poof! Mongdol appeared in front of Gildong in his normal size.

39
00:02:57.728 --> 00:02:59.349
He pointed to the red orb.

40
00:02:59.369 --> 00:03:03.190
"When you lived here, that was your treasure.

41
00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:07.971
It's a wish jewel that contains the powers of Heaven and Earth."

42
00:03:09.612 --> 00:03:10.692
Gildong blinked.

43
00:03:10.712 --> 00:03:12.693
"Why did I leave?

44
00:03:13.253 --> 00:03:15.653
This place seems so peaceful and beautiful.

45
00:03:16.374 --> 00:03:18.014
You know how lonely I am at home."

46
00:03:18.034 --> 00:03:23.816
"You must find your destiny," Mongdol said.

47
00:03:29.024 --> 00:03:31.085
"It's time to return to your world now.

48
00:03:32.185 --> 00:03:33.505
Take the wish jewel with you.

49
00:03:34.606 --> 00:03:35.866
Keep it with you always."

50
00:03:37.426 --> 00:03:39.567
Gildong stared at the large orb.

51
00:03:39.587 --> 00:03:43.288
"I'm supposed to carry this with me everywhere I go?

52
00:03:44.068 --> 00:03:45.069
Look at the size of it.

53
00:03:46.329 --> 00:03:50.650
Maybe if it was small like a—" A blinding light flashed.

54
00:03:54.071 --> 00:03:56.132
Now Gildong was holding a fan.

55
00:03:57.796 --> 00:03:58.917
Mongdol grinned.

56
00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:07.304
Gildong still didn't understand what was happening, but he nodded at Mongdol.

57
00:04:07.324 --> 00:04:10.107
"How do I get back to my world?"

58
00:04:11.948 --> 00:04:13.690
Mongdol pointed to the fan.

59
00:04:16.452 --> 00:04:17.833
Gildong opened it.

60
00:04:19.174 --> 00:04:20.796
Energy swirled around.

61
00:04:20.816 --> 00:04:24.078
"Wow," Gildong said.

62
00:04:24.098 --> 00:04:25.700
"Take me home!"
